  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{64425051F2E00216}" {
   m_sTitle "BLUFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "You are an infiltration team sent ahead of the main force to weaken the enemy. Try to maintain your concealment as long as possible. Any losses will spawn at main, and should decide on actions to best support the attack. There are three main objectives in blue. You must destroy the marked radars. Air support is grounded until those radars are destroyed. 30 minutes in, a breakthrough attempt will begin by AI blufor. Support them in their advance to the marked LOA. There are optional objectives marked in yellow. Destroying these will significantly weaken the enemy defence. "
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{64425051B9B5AF67}" {
   m_sTitle "OPFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "You've seen forces amasing east, and believe Blufor is pushing across the river tonight. Be on guard for any infilitration units sent ahead of the main attack."\
   ""\
   "ROE: If you find blufor, send up a flare and AI will begin moving on them. When the AI engages more fully, you can engage at that time. You have limited respawns, and as you lose objectives, you will lose the capabilities they represent. Feel free to use w/e you have available in a realistic defence."
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{644250519BE30999}" {
